            "review_title": "Review at Peaky Blinders Bakery And Butchers",
            "review_text": "Ian M\nBrisbane, Australia9 contributions\n0\nBlast from the past\nOct 2026 • Solo\nWe are living in Vung Tau……..have previously lived in HCMC and with my employment used to travel from there to the UK regularly. Marks English pork sausages and black pudding took me way back to my time in the UK. We cannot make english style sausages and black puddings like that in Oz or NZ where we hail from……this stiff is superb………even holidaying in apartment go get some and treat yourself to an English style brekkie….so worth it\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nBest English style sausages, black puddings I’ve had outside of England…superb\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten October 4, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
