            "review_title": "Review at Peaky Blinders Bakery And Butchers",
            "review_text": "Ken crow\nNewcastle upon Tyne, United Kingdom184 contributions\n1\nReally good quality food\nAug 2021 • Couples\nDuring these sad times, I called them last week to see if they could deliver to my address.\n\nWithin two hours I had freshly baked cornish pasties, sausage rolls, quiche and fresh bread, along with some bacon and sausages.\n\nAll of the goods were top quality, especially the cornish pasties.\n\nI will certainly be using them again.\nRead more\nWritten August 25, 2021",
